<properties>
{"title":"Close CRM SOPs (Setters)"}
</properties>
<content>
<callout icon="📊" color="gray_bg">
	CRM is your accountability tool. Bad notes = bad handoffs = lost deals. Every lead you touch must be logged before you log off.
</callout>
## 🔄 Status Workflow
**New Lead → Triage Call → Booked → Showed / No-Show**
---
## ☀️ Your Daily Starting Point
- Open Smart View: "My New Leads" — work this list before anything else
- Open Smart View: "My Booked Calls" — confirm today's scheduled calls
- Open Smart View: "No-Show Follow-Up" — re-engage leads who missed their calls
---
## 📋 Required After Every Triage Call
1. Update lead status immediately
2. Paste ChatGPT-optimized notes into contact Notes field (see Sales Process for prompt)
3. Assign lead to a closer
4. Set a follow-up task if the lead didn't book
---
## 📁 Required Fields on Every Contact
- Name, phone, email, Instagram handle
- Their situation + main goal
- Financial capacity (indirect qualification notes)
- Objections raised on triage call
- Intent level (Low / Medium / High)
---
<callout icon="⚡" color="yellow_bg">
	EOD Rule: Every lead you touched today must have an updated status and notes before you log off. CRM hygiene is non-negotiable.
</callout>
</content>
</page>
